<h3 class="font-headline-md text-on-surface mb-space-xs">Confirm Tip Deletion</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-space-lg">Are you sure you want to delete <span class="text-on-surface font-medium" id="delete-tip-title">this tip</span>? This action cannot be undone and will remove it from all active member feeds.</p>
